Referee: brute-force bounded inductor (verification/eq_brute.c) against code/eq_unary.c.
eq_brute visits every ordered list of concrete identities; eq_unary visits multisets of canonical identities with multiplicities.
Commands: eq_brute CAP L strict|loose [canon] [K R] > BRUTE.txt ; eq_unary CAP L > REF.txt ; python3 eq_compare_tables.py BRUTE.txt -- REF.txt

